<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62475" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτ-ᾰλέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fine, delicate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωνή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.571
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπήεισαν . . λεπταλέον σύριγγες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Dian.</u>
					243
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. φᾶρος, ἑανόν</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.169
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόδες</span> (of Hephaestus)
				<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				9.230
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠήρ, λύγοι</span>, etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				10.75
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				7.204
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>), etc.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοῦσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Aet.Oxy.</u>
					2079.24
				</span></i>
			; <i>feeble</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπταλέοι θυμοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					1.165
				</span></i>
			.</div>
